factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and slides say the 1,425 institutions where students can get the loan are where students 'சேரும்' (enroll), which matches the article, but the reel_script says '₹3.52 கோடி மதிப்பில் கடனுதவி' for the meeting place as loan amount for 'மாணவர்களுக்கு' generally; the headline and reel say ₹3.52 crore loans to students, while the article says 3.52 crore was for 50 beneficiaries (loans and construction-worker assistance combined), and 43 students received ₹3.17 crore, which the draft presents inconsistently.
  The slides state '50 பயனாளிகளுக்கு ₹3.52 கோடி மதிப்பில் உதவி' and the reel states the minister gave loans of ₹3.52 crore to students, but the article only says the minister gave 50 beneficiaries loans worth ₹3.52 crore, not that all were students.
  The reel_script says the minister gave loans to 50 beneficiaries and also construction worker assistance, but it omits that the construction workers received assistance ('கட்டுமான தொழிலாளர்களுக்கு உதவித்தொகை') in a clear way; the reel only mentions it vaguely.
  The reel_script and slides say 'கரூர் வருவாய் கோட்டாட்சியர்' (RDO) and 'மாவட்ட வருவாய் அலுவலர்' (DRO) and the MLA's party (த.வெ.க.) is omitted; the reel and slides describe the MLA without the party, which is not an error but the article says the MLA is from 'த.வெ.க.'.
  The reel_script says 'விபத்தில் உயிரிழந்ததால்' and describes 7 workers died 'பணியிடத்தில்' (at the workplace); the draft's phrasing 'பணியிடத்தில் விபத்தில் உயிரிழந்ததால்' is acceptable, but the slides 'விபத்தில் உயிரிழப்பு' omit that they died at the workplace.
